# State and testing

- Keep transient UI state local and derive values instead of duplicating state.
- Zustand + MMKV prefs are allowlisted for UI survival (period, last tab, lock prefs); add persisted fields only with a product need.
- Durable money data lives in SQLite repositories — test domain pure functions and repository mappers with deterministic fixtures.
- Mock native/SMS/filesystem boundaries, not internal implementation details.
- Test behavior and state transitions; keep tests deterministic and focused.
- Add regression coverage for bug fixes when practical.
- Prefer `react-hook-form` + Zod for non-trivial forms when introducing new ones.
